# Dev-only verification/demo scripts.
# These are internal tooling, not part of the product. They were previously
# committed and the SAST scan treated them as production code, reporting their
# dummy test values and debug console output as Critical/High findings.
# Keep such scripts out of the repository.
scripts/verify-*.ts
scripts/demo-*.ts

